  "description": "Astin Seymour is the antagonist in the romance novel The Story of Lillie. Her jealousy of the protagonist, Lillie, is what fuels her cruelty. However, now that I have taken over her body, the plot is changing. The real Astin hated Lillie, but she’s now my best friend. I would never hurt her, but I’m scared the real Astin will take over and harm Lillie. Because of that, I have no choice but to return to the world I came from. The only problem is… I have no recollection of that world. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
